# What `railway up <app dir>` must never upload (it also honours .gitignore).
# The Docker builds use their own allow-lists (apps/*/.dockerignore); this file guards
# the upload itself. Check the list before every upload (docs/runbooks/railway.md).

# secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jwk
*.crt
*.pfx
**/certs/
.envrc
**/.envrc
**/.npmrc
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*service-account*.json
**/signing_keys.json
supabase/roles.sql
supabase/signing_keys.json
supabase/

# dependencies, caches, build output
**/node_modules/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.next/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log

# not part of any image: operator tools, tests, evals (customer POs), docs, CI
apps/api/tools/
apps/api/tests/
apps/api/evals/
apps/web/e2e/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
docs/
